00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:47.200
It's also great when we all have
such a diverse experience, so

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:52.040
it would be great if ever you can
experience great social, in fact,

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.960
experience in Africa, Commercial Banking.

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:58.240
